# RevenueCat public SDK keys (safe to ship in the app; they are not secrets).
# "test_" keys use RevenueCat's Test Store and only work in development builds:
# the SDK deliberately crashes release builds (preview APK, production) that use one.
# Preview/production builds get their keys from eas.json → build.<profile>.env.
